ludus provides CMake targets:

    find_package(Ludus CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Ludus::Ludus)

  Feature-gated components ("occt", "robot") are exposed through the same
  package config; see share/ludus/LudusTargets.cmake for the targets present
  in this installation.

ludus also ships the canonical .NET, Python, and Rust SDK sources under
share/ludus/sdk; see share/ludus/sdk-layout.json for the layout.
